  instruction: Listen and choose the meaning.
  audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  spokenText: "Pokazal jesm svoje majstrovsko d\u011Blo dorastlym."
  options:
  - I asked the grown-ups to draw a hat.
  - The grown-ups showed me a book.
  - I made a copy of my masterpiece.
  - I showed my masterpiece to the grown-ups.
  correctIndex: 3
  explanation: "dorastlym = to the grown-ups. majstrovsko d\u011Blo = masterpiece."
